data: {"detail":"","state":"done","title":"Spotted 2 of 2 parts","track":"measure","type":"track"}

data: {"text":"That photo clearly shows a top-loader, not the front-loader on file — I'll check the library for the right washer.","type":"say"}

data: {"appliance":"front-load washer","brand":"Whirlpool","model_family":"WFW5720 4.5 cu. ft. Smart Front Load ENERGY STAR Washer with FreshFlow Vent System","type":"library"}

data: {"text":"The library only has that front-loader, so I'll search for safe top-load drain checks instead.","type":"say"}

data: {"action":{"queries":["site:whirlpool.com top load washer won't drain water left in tub drain hose check manual"],"query":"site:whirlpool.com top load washer won't drain water left in tub drain hose check manual","type":"search"},"type":"search"}

data: {"text":"I found Whirlpool's top-load guidance — I'll open the manual to confirm the drain checks.","type":"say"}

data: {"action":{"type":"open_page","url":"https://www.whirlpool.com/content/dam/global/documents/201212/owners-manual-W10280544-RevF.pdf"},"type":"search"}

data: {"text":"I'll look up the not-draining section in that manual.","type":"say"}

data: {"action":{"pattern":"not draining","type":"find_in_page","url":"https://www.whirlpool.com/content/dam/global/documents/201212/owners-manual-W10280544-RevF.pdf"},"type":"search"}

data: {"action":{"type":"open_page","url":"https://www.whirlpool.com/content/dam/global/documents/201212/owners-manual-W10280544-RevF.pdf"},"type":"search"}

data: {"text":"Thanks for that — I've got a safe top-load plan ready for you now.","type":"say"}

data: {"detail":"","state":"done","title":"Plan ready","track":"research","type":"track"}

data: {"plan":{"aftercare":"Empty pockets before washing, as small items can block draining.","appliance":"top-load washer","brand":"","diagnosis":"Water is stuck in the tub, likely from a kinked or clogged drain hose, an uneven load, or a small item slowing the pump. These safe checks clear the easy causes; if it still will not drain, the pump under the washer needs a pro.","library_id":"","library_problem":"","manual_url":"https://www.whirlpool.com/content/dam/global/documents/201212/owners-manual-W10280544-RevF.pdf","model_number":"","pro_visit_cost":250,"replacement_parts":[],"safety":["Turn the washer off and unplug it before bailing water.","Mop up spilled water so nobody slips.","Do not remove panels or reach under the washer — call a pro for the pump."],"steps":[{"check":"The panel is dark and the plug is out.","details":["Wait until the tub has stopped moving."],"instruction":"Turn washer off and unplug it","motion":"none","photo":-1,"show_3d":false,"target_part":"power cord behind the washer"},{"check":"Most water is out of the tub.","details":["Work slowly so water does not splash.","Set the bucket on a towel."],"instruction":"Scoop water from tub into bucket","motion":"none","photo":0,"show_3d":false,"target_part":"water and wet clothes in the round tub"},{"check":"The tub is empty, or clothes sit evenly around it.","details":["Even out heavy jeans and towels.","Check pockets for coins or small items."],"instruction":"Lift wet clothes out or spread evenly","motion":"lift","photo":0,"show_3d":false,"target_part":"wet clothes in the round tub"},{"check":"The hose has no sharp bends and sits loosely in the pipe.","details":["Look behind the washer without pulling it far.","Only about a hand's width goes into the pipe.","Do not tape it tightly shut."],"instruction":"Straighten thick drain hose behind washer","motion":"none","photo":-1,"show_3d":true,"target_part":"thick drain hose at the back of the washer"},{"check":"You hear draining, or the tub empties during the cycle.","details":["Choose Drain \u0026 Spin if your washer has it.","Stay nearby and watch for draining.","If nothing drains in 10 minutes, stop and call a pro."],"instruction":"Plug in, close lid, run Drain \u0026 Spin","motion":"push_in","photo":0,"show_3d":true,"target_part":"open white lid on top of the washer"}],"tools":["bucket","cup or small bowl","old towel"]},"type":"plan"}

